    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitiyanak Daudi Akis erwosit ŋolo a Gas",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Daudi totamatama alotau keŋ tema, “Epedori Saul akiar ayoŋ apeikoloŋit ŋirwa lupei lu. Ŋuna emaikina ayoŋ etiya iŋes akisii nakwap a Ŋipilistin; oeka aneni a Saul, ikotere nai eupi Saul akiwarit ayoŋ tooma akwap a Isirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Daudi torotok a nen kilamar nakwap a Ŋipilistin, erukito ka ŋikajiok ŋulu arukito ka iŋes ŋamiae ŋakanikapei. Tolot iŋes neni ka Akis alokoku a Maok a ŋolo alo Gas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiboiyoto Daudi ka ŋikajiok ŋulu arukito ka iŋes aneni ka Akis anakwap a ŋina a Gas. Arukito ŋinituŋanan kec ka ekal keŋ; Daudi daŋ arukito ka ŋaberu keŋ ŋaarei. Ainoam ŋina alo Yesireel ka Abigail ŋina alo Karimel, apuserut a Nabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elimokinio Saul atemar alot Daudi Gas, tojoŋo iŋes akiwarit Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Daudi neni ka Akis, “Ani kajok ayoŋ aneni kon, inakinae ayoŋ akibois adio alotaunio a akwap kon, ikotere ayoŋ eboi a nen, anerae nyejok ayoŋ eketiyan kon akiboi kaapei ka iyoŋ alotaun a ŋolo ipukator iyoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Akis akoloŋit ŋin inak Daudi etaun ŋolo enyaritae Sikilag. Aŋun, arubaki Sikilag erae etaun a ŋirwosi a Yudaya tari tokona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiboi Daudi anakwap a Ŋipilistin epeikaru ka ŋilapyo ŋiomwon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloseneneete Daudi ka ŋikajiok ŋulu arukito ka iŋes akirem Ŋigesuri, Ŋigirisi ka Ŋiamaleki; kiboiyete ŋituŋa ŋul ŋinapei koloŋ anakwap a ŋina eyai ameun alo Sur tari Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torem Daudi akwap ŋin neni aronon, nyimyek ekile, kori aberu eyari, tomyaa ŋamesekin, ŋaatuk, ŋisigirya, ŋikaala ka kiwok ŋilowi, toboŋorya neni ka Akis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iŋisi Akis iŋes etemari, “Ai iŋaarit iyoŋ ajore nakoloŋit na?” Toboŋokini Daudi tema, “Alosit ayoŋ akirem aonite ŋina a Yudaya, kori aonite ŋina a Yeramel, kori aonite ŋina a Ŋikeni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam ekile, kori aberu abu Daudi kimyek a nen eyari aŋuna ka akiya ŋakiro Gas. Etiyae Daudi ŋun aŋuna atamya ebe, “Epedorete ikes alimokin ŋituŋa a Gas atemar eyakae isua ne, etiyae Daudi ŋakiro ŋun ikotere edaun ituŋanan ŋini elimori ŋuna abu iŋes kitiya a nen.” Etiyae Daudi ŋakiro ŋun ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu eboiyo iŋes anakwap a Ŋipilistin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekinyomit Akis Daudi nooi aŋuna atamya ebe, “Nyeriŋa ŋituŋa a Daudi, Ŋisirael eminasi Daudi; aŋun, erubakini iŋes erae eketiyan kaŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
